kit wall_4  3.85 12 -33  rotate y 90
kit wall_4  3.85 15 -33  rotate y 90
kit wall_4  -3.85 12 -33  rotate y 90
kit wall_4  -3.85 15 -33  rotate y 90
kit floor_4  -2 18 -33
kit floor_4  2 18 -33

# The stars' places: a chimney 4 m wide to 12 m beside the start; a pillar 5 m off the top.
kit wall_4  4.85 0 4  rotate y 90
kit wall_4  4.85 3 4  rotate y 90
kit wall_4  4.85 6 4  rotate y 90
kit wall_4  4.85 9 4  rotate y 90
